              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwĩaĩi Yeova, ũla ũmbanasya alũngw’a ma Isilaeli, easya, Ngamũmbanĩsya angĩ, eka ala make ala mombanĩtw’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
